      "message": "\u003e BassClientService#isEnabled is an API and have the CTS test on it\n\n`BassClientService#isEnabled` is not an API and is not exposed over Binder, it\u0027s only usage is Config.java.\n\nThe `BluetoothLeBroadcastAssistantTest ` CTS test uses [`isLeAudioBroadcastAssistantSupported`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:cts/tests/tests/bluetooth/src/android/bluetooth/cts/BluetoothLeBroadcastAssistantTest.java;l\u003d179;drc\u003dc8c21dca6c98f12df34ced568b92e27c4d74303c) which is derived from the supported profiles declared in Config.java.\n\nAnother CTS test, `BluetoothConfigTest`, [check that the sysprop is enabled if `isLeAudioBroadcastSourceSupported` is true](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:cts/tests/tests/bluetooth/src/android/bluetooth/cts/BluetoothConfigTest.java;l\u003d195;drc\u003dc8c21dca6c98f12df34ced568b92e27c4d74303c).\n\nBTW now that you mention it are the CTS tests for `BluetoothLeBroadcastAssistantTest` passing with this change ? Those are currently not enabled on presubmit and postsubmit because Broadcast is not enabled on Cuttlefish.",
